# {{senseid|en|Lama guanicoe}} A [[South American]] [[ruminant]] ({{taxfmt|Lama guanicoe|species}}), closely related to the other [[lamoid]]s, the [[alpaca]], [[llama]], and [[vicuña]] in the family [[Camelidae]].

